       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. The 1600 mg single dose is also double the usual maximum of 800 mg per dose. At this level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury and cardiovascular events go up a lot, and the higher dose gives no added benefit.\n\nHere are some possible intended orders:\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum for inflammatory conditions or pain.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours**, the usual range for pain or fever.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg four times daily or 800 mg twice daily, if the 1600 was meant as a daily total.\n\nPlease confirm which dose you want, and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the clinical reason. I can enter it with a note documenting that you confirmed it, but I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
      }
     ],
